<%- include('partials/head') %><main id="main" class="wrap section"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Custom enquiry</div><div class="custom-layout"><aside><p class="eyebrow"><%= corporate?'A SWEETER WAY TO SAY THANK YOU':'YOUR IDEA, OUR NEXT CREATION' %></p><h1><%= title %></h1><p>Bring us your mood, your colours and your happy occasion. We’ll talk through the details together.</p><img class="custom-image" src="<%= imageUrl(site.promoImage) %>" alt="A celebration cake by _baking_co"><ol class="steps"><li>Tell us what you have in mind.</li><li>Your enquiry is saved with a reference.</li><li>Continue on WhatsApp to agree the details.</li></ol></aside><section class="checkout-card"><form id="custom-form"><label>Occasion or theme<input name="occasion" value="<%= query.occasion||(corporate?'Corporate gifting':'') %>" maxlength="120"></label><label>Your cake idea<textarea name="design" rows="4" minlength="5" maxlength="1500" placeholder="Colours, theme, names, decoration…" required></textarea></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Budget <small>(optional)</small><input name="budget" maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. ₹2,000–3,000"></label><label>Guests / servings<input name="servings" maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. 15 people"></label></div><%- include('partials/enquiry-fields') %></form><div id="enquiry-success" hidden></div></section></div></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
